# The proof leg (proofs/check.ps1, Phase 1754) installs the pinned F* release beside the models and
# keeps its checked-module cache and its fresh extractions under obj/. Neither is source: the
# release is a hash-verified download declared in fstar-pin.json, and the cache is PER INVOCATION
# (obj/cache-<pid>, one per running check.ps1) so that "cold cache" cannot be falsified by a second
# run in the same worktree.
.fstar/
obj/
